    "\n",
    "## Overview\n",
    "\n",
    "This analysis replicates the key drivers table using customer satisfaction survey data. We predict overall **satisfaction** from nine attribute ratings:\n",
    "*trust, build, differs, easy, appealing, rewarding, popular, service,* and *impact*.\n",
    "\n",
    "Six importance metrics are computed and displayed as normalized percentages (each column sums to 100), following the convention of slide 75 of the key drivers slides.\n",
    "\n",
    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## Setup & Data"
   ]
  },
